# final-run11: ultimate combination profile (fast TTFT 2.45s + fast TPOT 45ms)
# Token budget: 8192 (absorbs prompt prefill, keeps TPOT at 45 ms under 111 concurrency)
# Sequences: Uncapped (preserves 2.45s TTFT, no head-of-line blocking)
# Power: 350W (full compute TFLOPS to digest 8192 prefill without queue latency)
# Backend: FlashInfer (fast paged attention)
# Memory: 0.92, Context: 40960, Hybrid Cache: align
CMKL/MANGO1.5-Qwen3.5-9B-AWQ-W4A16-mtp
--host 0.0.0.0
--port 8000
--served-model-name mango1.5-awq-w4a16
--trust-remote-code
--gpu-memory-utilization 0.92
--max-model-len 40960
--max-num-batched-tokens 8192
--attention-backend FLASHINFER
--enable-prefix-caching
--mamba-cache-mode align
--enable-auto-tool-choice
--tool-call-parser qwen3_coder
--reasoning-parser qwen3
